---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../site.config.mjs';
---
<Page title="Affiliate and Referral Disclosure" description={`How ${SITE_NAME} earns money and how that does and does not affect our guides.`} updated="November 27, 2026">
  <p>{SITE_NAME} is reader-supported in two ways.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>When you buy a product through some links on this site, we may earn a commission from the seller. The price you pay is the same. Affiliate links are marked as sponsored to search engines.</p>
  <h2>Installer referrals</h2>
  <p>If you request a quote through our <a href="/find-an-installer/">find an installer</a> form, we may share your request with a licensed installer or a referral partner, and we may be paid for that referral. You contract with and pay the installer directly. We do not perform electrical work, set prices, or guarantee any installer's work, so check the license, insurance and permit plan of anyone you hire.</p>
  <h2>What this means for our guides</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Commissions and referral fees never decide recommendations. We will tell you when a cheaper option, or no purchase at all, is the better answer.</li>
    <li>Brands and installers cannot pay for placement or approval of a guide before it is published.</li>
    <li>If a brand gives us a product, we will say so in that guide.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>This disclosure follows the U.S. Federal Trade Commission's guidance on endorsements. Questions? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>.</p>
</Page>
